msgid "  CEM: Curves"
msgstr "  CEM: 彎道"

msgid "  CEM: Curves While Following"
msgstr "  CEM: 跟車時彎道"

msgid "  CEM: Slow Leads"
msgstr "  CEM: 慢速前車"

msgid " (Default)"
msgstr "(預設)"

msgid " Steering torque response calibration is complete."
msgstr " 轉向扭矩回應校正完成。"

msgid " Steering torque response calibration is {}% complete."
msgstr " 轉向扭矩回應校正已完成 {}%。"

msgid " Your device is pointed {:.1f}° {} and {:.1f}° {}."
msgstr " 您的裝置朝向 {:.1f}° {} 與 {:.1f}° {}。"

msgid "%"
msgstr "%"

msgid ""
"(Only for highest tiers, and does NOT bring ANY benefit to you yet. We are "
"just testing data volume.)"
msgstr "（僅適用於最高階別，尚未為您帶來任何好處。我們只是測試資料量。）"

msgid "(dark)"
msgstr "（深色）"

msgid "(off)"
msgstr "（關）"

msgid ", but we'll be here when you're ready to come back."
msgstr "，但當您準備好回來時，我們會在這裡。"

msgid "--"
msgstr "--"

msgid "---"
msgstr "---"

msgid "0=Off, 1=Limit to nav speed, 2=Limit with early decel."
msgstr "0=關閉，1=限制到導航限速，2=提前減速並限制到導航限速。"

msgid "0=Off, 1=Steering only, 2=Speed + steering (default), 3=Speed only."
msgstr "0=關閉，1=僅轉向，2=速度+轉向（預設），3=僅速度。"

msgid ""
"1 = take the ACC set speed from the car (PCM). Required on Toyota: its PCM "
"consumes the +/- buttons itself, so openpilot would otherwise keep its own "
"set speed while the cluster moves."
msgstr ""
"1 = 從車輛（PCM）取得 ACC 設定速度。豐田上必須開啟：其 PCM 會自行處理 +/- 按"
"鍵，否則儀表變化時 openpilot 仍會保留自己的設定速度。"

msgid "1 year of drive storage"
msgstr "1 年行駛資料儲存"

msgid "1. sunnypilot is a driver assistance system."
msgstr "1. sunnypilot 是駕駛輔助系統。"

msgid "2. You must pay attention at all times."
msgstr "2. 您必須全程保持專注。"

msgid "24/7 LTE connectivity"
msgstr "全年無休 LTE 連線"

msgid "2G"
msgstr "2G"

msgid "3-Finger"
msgstr "三指"

msgid "3. You must be ready to take over at any time."
msgstr "3. 您必須隨時準備接管車輛。"

msgid "3G"
msgstr "3G"

msgid "4-Finger"
msgstr "四指"

msgid "4. You are fully responsible for driving the car."
msgstr "4. 駕駛車輛的責任完全由您承擔。"

msgid "5-Finger"
msgstr "五指"

msgid "5G"
msgstr "5G"

msgid ""
"<b>Unsupported branch detected</b> - The current version of <b><u>%1</u></b> "
"branch is no longer supported on the comma three. Please go to <b>[Device > "
"Software]</b> and install a supported branch with <b><u>-tici</u></b> in the "
"branch name for the comma three."
msgstr ""
"<b>偵測到不受支援的分支</b> - 當前 <b><u>%1</u></b> 分支版本已不再支援 comma "
"three。請前往 <b>[裝置 > 軟體]</b> 安裝分支名稱包含 <b><u>-tici</u></b> 的受"
"支援分支。"

msgid ""
"<b>WARNING: sunnypilot longitudinal control is in alpha for this car and may "
"disable Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB).</b><br><br>On this car, "
"sunnypilot defaults to the car's built-in ACC instead of sunnypilot's "
"longitudinal control. Enable this to switch to sunnypilot longitudinal "
"control. Enabling Experimental mode is recommended when enabling sunnypilot "
"longitudinal control alpha. Changing this setting will restart sunnypilot if "
"the car is powered on."
msgstr ""
"<b>警告：此車型的 sunnypilot 縱向控制為 Alpha 版，可能停用自動緊急制動 "
"(AEB)。</b><br><br>此車型預設使用原廠 ACC 而非 sunnypilot 縱向控制。啟用此項"
"可切換至 sunnypilot 縱向控制。啟用縱向控制 Alpha 時建議同時啟用實驗模式。若車"
"輛通電，變更此設定將重啟 sunnypilot。"

msgid ""
"<b>WARNING: zoompilot longitudinal control is in alpha for this car and may "
"disable Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB).</b><br><br>On this car, zoompilot "
"defaults to the car's built-in ACC instead of zoompilot's longitudinal "
"control. Enable this to switch to zoompilot longitudinal control. Changing "
"this setting will restart zoompilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr ""
"<b>警告：zoompilot 縱向控制在當前車型上為 Alpha 版，可能導致自動緊急制動"
"（AEB）失效。</b><br><br>當前車型預設使用車輛自帶 ACC 而非 zoompilot 縱向控"
"制。開啟此項以切換到 zoompilot 縱向控制。車輛上電狀態下更改此設定將重啟 "
"zoompilot。"

msgid "<br><br>Steering lag calibration is complete."
msgstr "<br><br>轉向延遲校正完成。"

msgid "<br><br>Steering lag calibration is {}% complete."
msgstr "<br><br>轉向延遲校正已完成 {}%。"

msgid ""
"A beautiful rainbow effect on the path the model wants to take. It does not "
"affect driving in any way."
msgstr "在模型規劃路徑上顯示彩虹效果，純視覺裝飾，不影響駕駛。"

msgid ""
"A chime and on-screen alert will play when the traffic light you are waiting "
"for turns green and you have no vehicle in front of you.<br>Note: This chime "
"is only designed as a notification. It is the driver's responsibility to "
"observe their environment and make decisions accordingly."
msgstr ""
"等待的紅燈變綠且前方無車時，將播放提示音並顯示螢幕警報。<br>注意：此提示音僅"
"為通知，觀察環境並做出判斷仍是駕駛員的責任。"

msgid ""
"A chime and on-screen alert will play when you are stopped, and the vehicle "
"in front of you start moving.<br>Note: This chime is only designed as a "
"notification. It is the driver's responsibility to observe their environment "
"and make decisions accordingly."
msgstr ""
"停車時前方車輛起步，將播放提示音並顯示螢幕警報。<br>注意：此提示音僅為通知，"
"觀察環境並做出判斷仍是駕駛員的責任。"

msgid "A device is on the USB port."
msgstr "USB 連接埠上有裝置。"

msgid "ACC."
msgstr "ACC。"

msgid "ACTIVE"
msgstr "已啟用"

msgid "ACTUAL L.A."
msgstr "實際洛杉磯"

msgid ""
"ADB (Android Debug Bridge) allows connecting to your device over USB or over "
"the network. See https://docs.comma.ai/how-to/connect-to-comma for more info."
msgstr ""
"ADB（Android 偵錯橋）允許透過 USB 或網路連線裝置。詳見 https://docs.comma.ai/"
"how-to/connect-to-comma"

msgid "ADD"
msgstr "新增"

msgid "AHEAD"
msgstr "前方"

msgid "ALL TIME"
msgstr "累計"

msgid "ALT."
msgstr "ALT。"

msgid "APN Setting"
msgstr "APN 設定"

msgid "ATC Turn Control"
msgstr "ATC 轉彎控制"

msgid "About {size} can be freed"
msgstr "約可釋放 {size}"

msgid "Acceleration Boost"
msgstr "加速助力"

msgid "Acceleration Change Cost"
msgstr "加速度變化代價"

msgid "Acceleration Profile"
msgstr "加速曲線"

msgid "Acceleration Reduction"
msgstr "加速度降幅"

msgid "Access the device remotely using your SSH keys."
msgstr "使用您的 SSH 金鑰遠端存取裝置。"

msgid "Acknowledge Excessive Actuation"
msgstr "確認過度作動"

msgid "Actuator Delay:"
msgstr "執行器延遲："

msgid ""
"Adds a gentle nudge toward lane center on top of the model's own steering, "
"stronger when lane lines are clear. Yields around obstacles. The blue line "
"and the gauge under the torque bar show the strength and direction of "
"correction. The developer UI shows the exact adjustment in cm. Not available "
"with the Default model."
msgstr ""
"在模型自身轉向的基礎上輕微向車道中心修正，車道線清晰時修正更強。遇到障礙物會"
"讓行。藍線和扭矩條下方的儀表顯示修正的強度和方向。開發者介面以釐米顯示精確調"
"整量。預設模型下不可用。"

msgid ""
"Adds a small push on top of sunnypilot's own acceleration, stronger in "
"Aggressive and gentler in Relaxed. Eases off in curves and when sunnypilot "
"slows or stops. Never goes past your set speed, and lead-car following still "
"comes first."
msgstr ""
"在 sunnypilot 自身加速度之上疊加小幅助推，激進個性下更強、放鬆個性下更柔和。"
"過彎以及減速、停車時會自動收力。永遠不會超過你的設定車速，跟車避撞仍然優先。"

msgid ""
"Adds an offset to the speed limit.\n"
"Fixed adds a set amount of speed. % adds a percentage of the limit."
msgstr ""
"為限速增加偏移量。\n"
"固定值按固定速度疊加，% 按限速的百分比疊加。"

msgid "Adjust Camera Offset"
msgstr "調整相機偏移"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階"

msgid "Aggressive"
msgstr "激进"

msgid "Aggressive Personality"
msgstr "激進性格"

msgid "Agree"
msgstr "同意"

msgid "Alert Volume"
msgstr "提示音音量"

msgid "Alerts"
msgstr "警報"

msgid "All"
msgstr "全部"

msgid "All Speeds"
msgstr "所有速度"

msgid "All Speeds + Distance"
msgstr "所有速度 + 距離"

msgid "All provinces"
msgstr "所有省份"

msgid "All states (~6.0 GB)"
msgstr "所有狀態 (~6.0 GB)"

msgid "Allow cellular data roaming."
msgstr "允許行動數據漫遊。"

msgid "Allow other devices to find this device."
msgstr "允許其他裝置發現本裝置。"

msgid "Allow the curve trigger while following a lead car."
msgstr "跟車時也允許彎道觸發。"

msgid ""
"Allows the driver to provide limited steering input while openpilot is "
"engaged."
msgstr "允許駕駛員在 openpilot 接合時提供有限的轉向輸入。"

msgid "Alpha Longitudinal"
msgstr "Alpha 縱向控制"

msgid ""
"Alpha. Nudges the car toward the middle of the lane.\n"
"Stronger when the lane lines are clear. Yields around obstacles.\n"
"The center line turns blue as it nudges."
msgstr ""
"Alpha。將車輛輕微引向車道中間。\n"
"車道線清晰時更強，遇到障礙物會讓行。\n"
"微調時居中線變藍。"

msgid "Always On"
msgstr "永遠線上"

msgid "Always-On Driver Monitoring"
msgstr "持續啟用駕駛監控"

msgid ""
"An operating system update is required. Connect your device to Wi-Fi for the "
"fastest update experience. The download size is approximately 1GB."
msgstr ""
"需要更新作業系統。將裝置連上 Wi-Fi 可獲得最快的更新體驗。下載大小約為 1GB。"

msgid ""
"An update to your device's operating system is downloading in the "
"background. You will be prompted to update when it's ready to install."
msgstr "裝置作業系統更新正在背景下載。準備就緒後將提示您安裝。"

msgid "Any fast phone or laptop charger should be fine."
msgstr "任何快速的手機或筆電充電器都可以。"

msgid "Apply Model Speed"
msgstr "模型速度融合"

msgid ""
"Apply a custom timeout for settings UI.<br>This is the time after which "
"settings UI closes automatically if user is not interacting with the screen."
msgstr "為設定介面設定自定義超時。<br>使用者無操作後，設定介面將自動關閉。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to backup your current sunnypilot settings?"
msgstr "您確定要備份目前的 sunnypilot 設定嗎？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to clear the IMU calibration?"
msgstr "確定要清除 IMU 校正嗎？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to enter Always Offroad mode?"
msgstr "確定要進入始終離路模式嗎？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to exit Always Offroad mode?"
msgstr "確定要退出始終離路模式嗎？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to power off?"
msgstr "確定要關機嗎？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to reboot?"
msgstr "確定要重新啟動嗎？"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to reset all zoompilot settings to default? Once the "
"settings are reset, there is no going back."
msgstr "確定要將所有 zoompilot 設定恢復為預設值嗎？設定一旦重置將無法撤銷。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to reset calibration?"
msgstr "確定要重設校正嗎？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to reset your device?"
msgstr "您確定要重置您的裝置嗎？"

msgid ""
"Resetting device...\n"
"This may take up to a minute."
msgstr ""
"正在重置裝置...\n"
"這可能需要長達一分鐘的時間。"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to restore the last backed up sunnypilot settings?"
msgstr "您確定要還原上次備份的 sunnypilot 設定嗎？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to uninstall?"
msgstr "確定要解除安裝嗎？"

msgid ""
"Ask Open-Meteo for the conditions where the car is, instead of entering them "
"by hand. Uses the mobile data connection while driving."
msgstr ""
"根據車輛所在位置向 Open-Meteo 查詢即時天氣，無需手動填寫。行駛中會使用行動數"
"據網路。"

msgid ""
"Ask before taking a new speed limit. Adds to the low-speed confirmation, "
"never replaces it."
msgstr "採用新限速前先詢問確認。在低速確認的基礎上疊加，絕不會取代它。"

msgid "Assist"
msgstr "協助"

msgid ""
"Assist: Sets cruise to the speed limit. When asked, press + or - to accept."
msgstr "輔助：將定速設為限速值。收到提示時按 + 或 - 確認。"

msgid ""
"Assist: Slows to the speed limit, up to your set speed. Tap gas to keep your "
"speed."
msgstr "輔助：減速至限速值（不超過你設定的速度）。踩油門可保持目前速度。"

msgid ""
"Assist: when the limit changes, press - or + to set your speed to match.\n"
"Info and warn show the sign on a comma 3X only."
msgstr ""
"輔助：限速變化時，按 - 或 + 讓設定速度與之匹配。\n"
"提示與警告僅在 comma 3X 上顯示標誌。"

msgid "Audible"
msgstr "帶提示音"

msgid "Auto"
msgstr "自動"

msgid "Auto (Dark)"
msgstr "自動（深色）"

msgid "Auto (Default)"
msgstr "自動（預設）"

