msgstr "自動油門"

msgid "Auto Gas Sync Speed"
msgstr "自動油門同步速度"

msgid "Auto Lane Change by Blinker"
msgstr "Blinker 自動變換車道"

msgid "Auto Lane Change: Delay with Blind Spot"
msgstr "自動變換車道：有盲點的延誤"

msgid "Auto Start / Cruise"
msgstr "自動啟動 / 巡航"

msgid "Auto Turn Control"
msgstr "自動轉向控制"

msgid "Auto Turn Distance Offset"
msgstr "自動轉向距離偏移"

msgid "Auto Turn End Distance"
msgstr "自動轉向結束距離"

msgid "Auto Turn Speed Threshold"
msgstr "自動轉向車速閾值"

msgid "Auto Turn on Navi Lane Change"
msgstr "導航變道時自動轉向"

msgid "Auto Up 40 km/h Highway Limit"
msgstr "高速 40 km/h 限速自動提升"

msgid "Auto Up 40 km/h Road Limit"
msgstr "40 km/h 限速自動提升"

msgid "Auto Up Highway Limit"
msgstr "高速公路限速自動提升"

msgid "Auto Up Road Limit"
msgstr "自動提升道路限速"

msgid ""
"Auto follows the limit your car shows, and the map where it shows none.\n"
"The map also slows you before a lower limit ahead.\n"
"Car or map uses only that one."
msgstr ""
"自動：優先跟隨車輛顯示的限速，車輛未顯示時使用地圖限速。\n"
"地圖還會在前方限速降低前提前減速。\n"
"「僅車輛」或「僅地圖」則只使用其中一種。"

msgid ""
"Auto: Follow the limit your car shows, and the map where it shows none. The "
"map also slows you before a lower limit ahead."
msgstr ""
"自動：優先跟隨車輛顯示的限速，車輛未顯示時使用地圖限速。地圖還會在前方限速降"
"低前提前減速。"

msgid "Automatic turn, fork / merge and curve speed control."
msgstr "自動轉向、岔路/匯入與彎道速度控制。"

msgid "Available devices"
msgstr "可用裝置"

msgid "B.D."
msgstr "B.D."

msgid "BSD Detection Threshold"
msgstr "盲區偵測閾值"

msgid "BSD Inference Interval"
msgstr "盲區推理間隔"

msgid "BSD Smoothing Time"
msgstr "盲區平滑時間"

msgid "BYD only: feed corner-radar tracks into the radar interface."
msgstr "僅比亞迪：把角雷達軌跡輸入雷達介面。"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "返回"

msgid "Backing up {progress}%"
msgstr "備份中 {progress}%"

msgid "Backup"
msgstr "備份"

msgid "Backup Failed"
msgstr "備份失敗"

msgid "Backup Settings"
msgstr "備份設定"

msgid "Battery"
msgstr "電量"

msgid "Become a comma prime member at connect.comma.ai"
msgstr "前往 connect.comma.ai 成為 comma prime 會員"

msgid ""
"Become a sponsor of sunnypilot to get early access to sunnylink features "
"when they become available."
msgstr ""
"成為 sunnypilot 的贊助商，以便儘早使用 sunnylink 功能（當這些功能可用時）。"

msgid ""
"Before we get on the road, let's finish installation and cover some details."
msgstr "在我們上路之前，讓我們完成安裝並介紹一些細節。"

msgid ""
"Below this curve speed (km/h), the lane-line curvature correction is "
"suppressed so tight bends rely on the map/vision curve speed alone. 0 "
"disables the gate."
msgstr ""
"彎道速度低於該值（km/h）時抑制車道線曲率修正，急彎只依賴地圖/視覺彎道速度。0 "
"表示不啟用。"

msgid "Big Model"
msgstr "大模型"

msgid "Big model unavailable until the next drive."
msgstr "大模型不可用，下次行駛前無法使用。"

msgid "Big model unavailable, {} is driving until the next drive."
msgstr "大模型不可用，下次行駛前由 {} 駕駛。"

msgid "Blind Spot"
msgstr "盲點"

msgid "Block Lane Change: Road Edge Detection"
msgstr "Block Lane Change: Road Edge Detection"

msgid ""
"Blocks a lane change toward a road edge the model sees.\n"
"Silent shows the alert without the chime."
msgstr ""
"模型檢測到前方道路邊緣時阻止向該方向變道。\n"
"靜音只顯示提示而不響鈴。"

msgid ""
"Blocks the lane change if the model sees a road edge on your signaled side. "
"Silent shows the alert without the chime."
msgstr ""
"當模型在轉向燈一側看到路沿時阻止變道。靜默模式只顯示提醒，不播放提示音。"

