"Learns how your car steers as you drive and tunes to match.\n"
"It learns each speed range separately."
msgstr ""
"在行駛中學習您車輛的轉向特性並自動匹配調校。\n"
"每個速度區間分別學習。"

msgid ""
"Lengthen the follow time, widen the stopped gap and lower the acceleration "
"and lateral limits in bad weather. The weather is detected from the car's "
"position; these offsets are what gets applied."
msgstr ""
"惡劣天氣下延長跟車時距、加大停車間距並降低加速度與橫向加速度上限。天氣根據車"
"輛位置自動偵測；此處設定的是實際疊加的補償量。"

