"Let the Carrot app's turn instruction act as a turn signal and steer for "
"exits and turns. On by default; turn off if you don't want navigation to "
"actuate the signal."
msgstr ""
"讓 Carrot 應用的轉向指令充當方向燈，在出匝和轉彎時自動打燈。預設開啟；若不想"
"讓導航控制方向燈請關閉。"

