"Let the driving model control gas and brakes.\n"
"Includes stopping for red lights and stop signs.\n"
"Set speed is a maximum, not a target.\n"
"These are alpha features. Expect mistakes.\n"
"The path colors show acceleration and braking."
msgstr ""
"由駕駛模型控制油門和剎車。\n"
"包括紅燈和停車標誌前的停車。\n"
"設定速度只是上限，而非目標車速。\n"
"這些是 alpha 功能，可能出現錯誤。\n"
"路徑顏色表示加速和制動。"

msgid "Let the driving model control the gas and brakes."
msgstr "讓駕駛模型控制油門和剎車。"

msgid ""
"Let the phone app drive the longitudinal plan: its target speed becomes a "
"plan source, and its follow time, comfort braking and stop point reach the "
"MPC. Off keeps stock sunnypilot behaviour. Needs a connected phone - without "
"a fresh packet the source stays inactive."
msgstr ""
"讓手機 App 驅動縱向規劃：其目標速度成為一個規劃源，其跟車時距、舒適制動與停車"
"點進入 MPC。關閉時保持 sunnypilot 原廠行為。需要手機保持連線——沒有新鮮資料時"
"該源自動失效。"

