"Lets you choose how sunnypilot starts, catches up, and settles at the cruise "
"speed. Emergency braking and stopping are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"讓您選擇 sunnypilot 如何起步、跟上並穩定在巡航速度。緊急煞車與停車行為不變。"

