msgid ""
"Play the green light and lead depart chimes even while cruise is engaged\n"
"and holding at a standstill. Without it they only chime while cruise\n"
"is off. Check the road before you go."
msgstr ""
"即使巡航已掛入且在靜止等待時，也播放綠燈和前車起步提示音。\n"
"不開啟則僅在巡航關閉時響鈴。\n"
"起步前請注意觀察路況。"

msgid ""
"Play the green traffic light and lead departure alerts even when cruise is "
"engaged and holding the car at a standstill.<br>Without this, those alerts "
"only chime while cruise is disengaged. ACC holding at a light never starts "
"moving by itself.<br>Note: This chime is only designed as a notification. It "
"is the driver's responsibility to observe their environment and make "
"decisions accordingly."
msgstr ""
"即使巡航已接管並在紅燈前保持靜止，也播放綠燈與前車起步提醒。<br>否則這些提醒"
"只在巡航未接管時播放。ACC 在紅燈前保持靜止時不會自行起步。<br>注意：此提示音"
"僅作為通知。駕駛員有責任觀察周圍環境並做出相應判斷。"

