msgid ""
"Routes auto-delete when free space is below 10% or 5 GB (oldest first). "
"Upload is not required. Starred routes are kept."
msgstr ""
"可用空間低於 10% 或 5 GB 時，系統會自動刪除最舊路線（與是否上傳無關），收藏路"
"線會保留。"

msgid "Run big models over a connected device running Jetlink. Turns off ADB."
msgstr "透過執行 Jetlink 的外接裝置執行大模型。會關閉 ADB。"

msgid "Run lateral maneuvers for testing steering control."
msgstr "執行橫向測試動作，用於檢驗轉向控制。"

msgid "Run longitudinal maneuvers for testing gas and brake control."
msgstr "執行縱向測試動作，用於檢驗油門與剎車控制。"

msgid ""
"Run the ONNX blind-spot model on the camera image and report side obstacles "
"in the UI. Off unloads the model and frees its memory; the thresholds below "
"have no effect."
msgstr ""
"在攝影機畫面上執行 ONNX 盲區模型，並在 UI 中報告側方障礙物。關閉時卸載模型並"
"釋放記憶體；下方閾值設定將不起作用。"

msgid ""
"Run the YOLOv8 traffic-light detector on the road camera and draw a box "
"around each detected signal housing on the driving view, with the observed "
"signal (red light, green light, turn arrows) written under the box.<br>Runs "
"at most 2 Hz on the little cores and is display only: it never feeds the "
"planner and never lets openpilot act on a traffic light on your behalf. "
"Always check the light yourself."
msgstr ""
"在行車畫面上執行 YOLOv8 紅綠燈偵測器，為每個偵測到的號誌燈組畫框，並在框下方"
"標註目前觀察到的號誌（紅燈、綠燈、轉向箭頭）。<br>最多以 2 Hz 執行於小核心，"
"僅供顯示：不會進入規劃器，也不會代替 openpilot 對紅綠燈做任何操作。請務必自行"
"注意號誌。"

msgid ""
"Runs big models on a computer or phone plugged into the comma.\n"
"USB for a Mac, Jetson, Linux PC or Android. iOS for an iPhone or iPad.\n"
"Turns off ADB. The small model drives until the big model is ready."
msgstr ""
"在接入 comma 的電腦或手機上執行大模型。\n"
"Mac、Jetson、Linux 電腦或安卓裝置用 USB；iPhone 或 iPad 用 iOS。\n"
"會關閉 ADB。大模型就緒前由小模型駕駛。"

