"Alerts brighten the screen again."
msgstr ""
"行駛時的螢幕亮度（在亮度延時之後生效）。\n"
"自動（暗）允許自動亮度降得更暗。\n"
"出現提示時會再次提亮螢幕。"

msgid "Scroll to continue"
msgstr "滾動以繼續"

msgid "Search"
msgstr "搜尋"

msgid "Search your vehicle"
msgstr "搜尋您的車輛"

msgid "Seconds added to the follow time in bad weather."
msgstr "惡劣天氣下額外增加的跟車時距（秒）。"

msgid "Section Average Speed"
msgstr "區間平均速度"

msgid "Section Avg Control"
msgstr "區間平均控制"

msgid "Section Avg Margin"
msgstr "區間平均餘量"

msgid "Select"
msgstr "選取"

msgid "Select Country"
msgstr "選擇國家"

msgid "Select Province"
msgstr "選擇省份"

msgid "Select State"
msgstr "選擇州/省"

msgid "Select Torque Control Tune Version"
msgstr "選擇扭力控制調節版本"

msgid "Select a Model"
msgstr "選擇車型"

msgid "Select a branch"
msgstr "選取分支"

msgid "Select a language"
msgstr "選取語言"

msgid "Select a vehicle"
msgstr "選擇車輛"

msgid ""
"Select the version of Torque Control Tune to use while a big model is "
"driving."
msgstr "選擇大模型駕駛時使用的扭矩控制調校版本。"

msgid ""
"Select the version of Torque Control Tune to use while the small model is "
"driving."
msgstr "選擇小模型駕駛時使用的扭矩控制調校版本。"

msgid "Select vehicle to force fingerprint manually."
msgstr "選擇車輛以手動強制指紋。"

msgid "Selecting a higher finger count may reduce accidental activations."
msgstr "選擇較多的手指數量可減少誤觸。"

msgid "Self-Tune"
msgstr "自整定"

msgid ""
"Self-tune learns from fewer samples.\n"
"It accepts values further from the car's defaults."
msgstr ""
"自學習使用的樣本更少。\n"
"它會接受偏離車輛預設值更大的數值。"

msgid "Send navigation-based speed limits to the car over CAN."
msgstr "透過 CAN 把基於導航的限速資訊傳給車輛。"

msgid "Serial"
msgstr "序號"

msgid ""
"Serve the carrot tuning page (/nav_params) and four-corner radar "
"visualisation (/radar) on port 8088."
msgstr ""
"在 8088 連接埠提供 Carrot 調參頁面（/nav_params）與四角雷達視覺化（/radar）。"

msgid "Set Speed Assist"
msgstr "設定速度輔助"

msgid ""
"Set a timer to delay the auto lane change operation when the blinker is "
"used. No nudge on the steering wheel is required to auto lane change if a "
"timer is set. Default is Nudge.<br>Please use caution when using this "
"feature. Only use the blinker when traffic and road conditions permit."
msgstr ""
"使用轉向燈時設定延遲計時器以延遲自動變道。設定計時器後無需輕推方向盤即可變"
"道，預設為輕推。<br>請謹慎使用，僅在交通和路況允許時使用轉向燈。"

msgid ""
"Set how far a short press and a long press of + or - move your set speed."
msgstr "設定短按和長按 + 或 - 時調整設定速度的幅度。"

msgid ""
"Set how sensitive the driver distraction detection should be. Strict: Very "
"sensitive, warns on minor distractions. Moderate: Balanced between "
"sensitivity and false positives. Lenient: Only alerts on clear distractions. "
"Extra Lenient: Alerts only on sustained, obvious distractions (longest grace "
"period)."
msgstr ""
"設定駕駛員分心偵測的靈敏度。嚴格：非常靈敏，輕微分心也會警告。中等：在靈敏度"
"與誤報之間平衡。寬鬆：僅在明顯分心時提醒。最寬鬆：僅在持續、明顯的分心時提醒"
"（寬限期最長）。"

msgid ""
"Set the access point name required by your cellular carrier. Leave blank for "
"automatic configuration."
msgstr "設定運營商要求的 APN 名稱。留空則自動配置。"

msgid ""
"Setting or resuming a cruise speed also turns steering on.\n"
"Steering then stays on until you switch it off or turn off the car."
msgstr ""
"設定或恢復巡航車速時也會開啟轉向。\n"
"轉向將保持開啟，直到你手動關閉或熄火。"

msgid ""
"Setting or resuming a cruise speed also turns steering on. Steering then "
"stays on until you switch it off or turn off the car."
msgstr ""
"設定或恢復巡航車速時也會開啟轉向，轉向將保持開啟，直到你手動關閉或熄火。"

msgid "Settings backup completed."
msgstr "設定備份完成。"

msgid "Settings restored. Confirm to restart the interface."
msgstr "設定已恢復。確認重啟介面。"

msgid "Share the device's internet connection through a Wi-Fi hotspot."
msgstr "透過 Wi-Fi 熱點共享裝置的網路連線。"

msgid ""
"Sharing your data with comma helps improve openpilot and sunnypilot for "
"everyone."
msgstr "與 comma 分享您的資料，能協助改善所有人的 openpilot 與 sunnypilot。"

msgid "Shift the auto turn trigger point earlier or later."
msgstr "讓自動過彎觸發點提前或延後。"

msgid ""
"Shifts where the model thinks the camera sits.\n"
"Positive moves the car left, negative right."
msgstr ""
"調整模型認為攝像頭所在的位置。\n"
"正值讓車輛偏左，負值偏右。"

msgid "Short Press Increment"
msgstr "短按增量"

msgid "Show Advanced Controls"
msgstr "顯示進階控制項"

msgid "Show Blind Spot Warnings"
msgstr "顯示盲點警告"

msgid "Show Debug Log"
msgstr "顯示除錯日誌"

msgid "Show Driving Model on Home Screen"
msgstr "主屏顯示駕駛模型"

msgid ""
"Show a screen saver when the device is offroad and idle, instead of turning "
"the screen off."
msgstr ""
"Show a screen saver when the device is offroad and idle, instead of turning "
"the screen off."

msgid "Show a timer on the HUD when the car is at a standstill."
msgstr "當汽車處於靜止狀態時，HUD 上顯示計時器。"

msgid ""
"Show an indicator on the left side of the screen to display real-time "
"vehicle acceleration and deceleration. This displays what the car is "
"currently doing, not what the planner is requesting."
msgstr ""
"在螢幕左側顯示實時加減速指示條，反映車輛當前實際加減速，而非規劃器請求值。"

msgid "Show debug overlays on the external cluster."
msgstr "在外接儀表上顯示除錯疊加層。"

msgid "Show touch locations and the UI frame rate."
msgstr "顯示觸控位置和介面幀率。"

msgid ""
"Shows a QR code to sponsor sunnypilot, the project behind sunnylink.\n"
"Sponsors get early access to new sunnylink features."
msgstr ""
"顯示贊助 sunnypilot（sunnylink 背後的專案）的二維碼。\n"
"贊助者可提前體驗 sunnylink 新功能。"

msgid "Shows a screen saver when offroad and idle, instead of a dark screen."
msgstr "離車且空閒時顯示螢幕保護，而不是黑屏。"

msgid "Shows a warning on screen when a car is in your blind spot."
msgstr "盲區有車時在螢幕上顯示警告。"

msgid "Shows the driving model's name at the bottom of the home screen."
msgstr "在主屏底部顯示駕駛模型的名稱。"

msgid ""
"Shows the model's confidence as a ball on your side of the screen, as on the "
"comma 4: higher is more confident, and while engaged it is green, then "
"yellow, then red as confidence drops."
msgstr ""
"在螢幕上你所在的一側以球體顯示模型的置信度，與 comma 4 相同：位置越高越有信"
"心，接管狀態下置信度從高到低依次為綠色、黃色、紅色。"

msgid ""
"Shrink the follow distance as speed rises. Off disables it; the three "
"profiles differ in how far up the speed range the gap keeps tightening."
msgstr ""
"車速升高時縮短跟車距離。關閉則不啟用；三個設定的差別在於跟車距離持續收緊到多"
"高的車速。"

msgid "Side Blind Spot Delay"
msgstr "側向盲區延遲"

msgid "Side Relative Distance Time"
msgstr "側向相對距離時間"

msgid "Side vRel Distance Time"
msgstr "側向相對速度時間"

msgid "Silent"
msgstr "靜默"

msgid "Slow"
msgstr "慢"

msgid ""
"Slow automatic lane changes to a chosen pace. Off is stock; every pace is "
"gentler than stock. The end-of-maneuver correction keeps its authority at "
"every pace, so the car settles into the new lane without a wheel snap."
msgstr ""
"將自動變道放慢到選定節奏。關閉即原廠；每個檔位都比原廠更輕柔。變道末段的修正"
"力在各檔位下保持不變，車輛可平穩進入新車道，不會出現方向盤猛回。"

msgid "Slow for Curves: Map"
msgstr "彎道減速：地圖"

msgid "Slow for Curves: Vision"
msgstr "彎道減速：視覺"

msgid ""
"Slows for curves in map data, then resumes your set speed.\n"
"Download maps in sunnylink first."
msgstr ""
"根據地圖資料中的彎道減速，隨後恢復設定速度。\n"
"請先在 sunnylink 中下載地圖。"

msgid ""
"Slows for curves the camera sees, then resumes your set speed.\n"
"Works alone or with slow for curves: map."
msgstr ""
"攝影機看到彎道時減速，隨後恢復設定速度。\n"
"可單獨使用，也可與“地圖彎道減速”配合。"

msgid "Small Model"
msgstr "小模型"

msgid "Small Model Steering"
msgstr "小模型轉向"

msgid "Snooze Update"
msgstr "延後更新"

msgid "Software"
msgstr "軟體"

msgid "Software Delay:"
msgstr "軟體延遲："

msgid "Software H.264"
msgstr "軟體 H.264"

msgid "Speed"
msgstr "速度"

msgid "Speed + Distance"
msgstr "速度+距離"

msgid "Speed Bump End Distance"
msgstr "減速帶結束距離"

msgid "Speed Bump Hold Time"
msgstr "減速帶保持時間"

msgid "Speed Bump Target Speed"
msgstr "減速帶目標速度"

msgid "Speed Bumps"
msgstr "減速帶"

msgid "Speed Camera Alert Time"
msgstr "測速相機提前提醒時間"

msgid "Speed Camera Control Mode"
msgstr "測速相機控制模式"

msgid "Speed Limit"
msgstr "速度極限"

msgid "Speed Limit Offset"
msgstr "速度限制偏移"

msgid "Speed Limit Source"
msgstr "限速源"

msgid "Speed Only"
msgstr "僅速度"

msgid "Speed Source PCM"
msgstr "車速來源 PCM"

msgid "Speed at which cruise set speed is re-synchronized. Tesla BYD only."
msgstr "巡航設定速度重新同步的速度門檻。僅限特斯拉、比亞迪。"

msgid "Speed below which auto turn activates."
msgstr "自動過彎功能啟動的車速上限。"

msgid "Speed-dependent Follow Time"
msgstr "隨速度變化跟車時間"

msgid "Speedometer: Always Display True Speed"
msgstr "車速表：始終顯示真實速度"

msgid "Speedometer: Hide from Onroad Screen"
msgstr "車速表：從道路螢幕上隱藏"

msgid "Sponsor Status"
msgstr "贊助商狀態"

msgid "Sponsorship isn't required for basic backup/restore"
msgstr "基本備份/恢復不需要贊助"

msgid "Sport"
msgstr "運動"

msgid "Standard"
msgstr "標準"

msgid "Standard Personality"
msgstr "標準性格"

msgid ""
"Standard is recommended.\n"
"Aggressive follows closer, with firmer gas and braking.\n"
"Relaxed leaves more space.\n"
"Use the steering wheel distance button on supported cars."
msgstr ""
"推薦使用標準。\n"
"激進：跟車更近，加減速更果斷。\n"
"輕鬆：留出更大車距。\n"
"支援的車型可用方向盤上的車距按鍵切換。"

msgid ""
"Standard is recommended. In aggressive mode, sunnypilot will follow lead "
"cars closer and be more aggressive with the gas and brake. In relaxed mode "
"sunnypilot will stay further away from lead cars. On supported cars, you can "
"cycle through these personalities with your steering wheel distance button."
msgstr ""
"建議使用標準模式。激進模式下跟車更近、加減速更積極；從容模式下跟車更遠。部分"
"車型可透過方向盤距離按鍵切換駕駛風格。"

msgid "Start / Engage"
msgstr "啟動 / 接管"

msgid "Start Download"
msgstr "開始下載"

msgid "Start IMU Calibration"
msgstr "開始 IMU 校正"

msgid "Start over"
msgstr "重新開始"

msgid "Start the Bluetooth service to scan and pair devices."
msgstr "啟動藍牙服務以掃描並配對裝置。"

msgid "Start the vehicle to check vehicle compatibility."
msgstr "啟動車輛以檢查車輛相容性。"

msgid "State"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Status Details"
msgstr "狀態詳細資料"

msgid "Steer Delay"
msgstr "轉向延遲"

msgid "Steer Ratio Rate"
msgstr "轉向比縮放"

msgid "Steer When Cruise On"
msgstr "巡航開啟時轉向"

msgid "Steer When Cruise Set"
msgstr "巡航設定時轉向"

msgid "Steer Without Cruise"
msgstr "無巡航轉向"

msgid "Steering"
msgstr "橫向控制"

msgid "Steering Arc"
msgstr "轉向弧"

msgid "Steering Suspend"
msgstr "轉向暫停"

msgid ""
"Steering angle at which lateral control pauses while you steer. 300° "
"effectively disables it. CarrotPilot stores 0.1-degree units for this "
"parameter but its code, like this port, compares the raw value against the "
"steering angle, so the number reads as degrees here."
msgstr ""
"轉向角超過該值時，橫向控制會在你轉向期間暫停。300° 實際上等於關閉。"
"CarrotPilot 為此參數宣告了 0.1 度單位，但它的程式碼與本移植一樣，直接拿原始值"
"與轉向角比較，所以這裡的數值按度理解。"

msgid ""
"Steering geometry, MPC costs, torque tuning, lane change and blind spot."
msgstr "轉向幾何、MPC 代價、扭矩調校、變道與盲區。"

msgid "Steering on Brake"
msgstr "剎車時轉向"

msgid "Steering-wheel nudge when carrot decelerates for a speed camera."
msgstr "carrot 因測速相機減速時輕振方向盤。"

msgid ""
"Steers with torque control, using zoompilot's tunes.\n"
"The tune version, self tune and custom tune settings need it on."
msgstr ""
"使用 zoompilot 調校的扭矩控制轉向。\n"
"調校版本、自學習和自定義調校設定需要此項開啟。"

msgid ""
"Steers with your values at every speed, ignoring self-tune.\n"
"Changes apply within a few seconds, even while driving."
msgstr ""
"在各速度區間都使用您設定的數值轉向，忽略自學習。\n"
"更改在數秒內生效，行駛中也可生效。"

msgid "Stock"
msgstr "原廠"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Stop / Speed Camera"
msgstr "停止線 / 測速照相"

msgid "Stop Distance"
msgstr "停車距離"

msgid "Stop Test"
msgstr "停止試驗"

msgid "Stop and Go (Beta)"
msgstr "走走停停（測試版）"

msgid "Stop and Go Hack (Alpha)"
msgstr "走走停停破解 (Alpha)"

msgid "Stop and Go for Manual Parking Brake (Beta)"
msgstr "手動駐車煞車（測試版）走走停停"

msgid "Stops the model download in progress."
msgstr "停止正在進行的模型下載。"

msgid "Storage"
msgstr "儲存"

msgid "Storage Used"
msgstr "儲存佔用"

msgid "Storage is running low (less than 10% free)."
msgstr "儲存空間不足（可用低於 10%）。"

msgid "Strict"
msgstr "嚴格"

msgid "Sunnylink Local Connections"
msgstr "Sunnylink 本機連線"

msgid "Supply Current"
msgstr "供電電流"

msgid "Supply Fault"
msgstr "供電故障"

msgid "Supply Voltage"
msgstr "供電電壓"

msgid ""
"Suppress the door-open engage block. The car still shows its own warning; "
"use only if a sensor falsely reports an open door."
msgstr ""
"屏蔽車門未關導致的接管禁止。車輛自身仍會顯示警告；僅在感測器誤報車門開啟時使"
"用。"

msgid ""
"Suppress the seatbelt-not-latched engage block. The car still shows its own "
"warning; use only where the belt is genuinely fastened."
msgstr ""
"屏蔽安全帶未繫導致的接管禁止。車輛自身仍會顯示警告；僅在安全帶確實繫好時使"
"用。"

msgid ""
"Synthesises a camera distance when the car sends only an enforcement speed. "
"0.1 s units; 60 = 6.0 s."
msgstr "當車輛只送出執法測速值時的合成相機距離。單位為 0.1 秒；60 = 6.0 秒。"

msgid "System Reset"
msgstr "系統重置"

msgid "System Unresponsive"
msgstr "系統無回應"

msgid "System reboot required for changes to take effect. Reboot now?"
msgstr "需要重新啟動系統才能使變更生效。現在重啟？"

msgid ""
"System reset triggered. Press confirm to erase all content and settings. "
"Press cancel to resume boot."
msgstr "系統重置被觸發。按確認刪除所有內容和設定。按取消恢復啟動。"

msgid "TAKE CONTROL IMMEDIATELY"
msgstr "立即接管控制"

msgid "TEMP"
msgstr "溫度"

msgid "THANKS ♥"
msgstr "謝謝♥"

msgid "TSS2 Smooth Longitudinal (Alpha)"
msgstr "TSS2 平順縱向控制（Alpha）"

msgid "Taking camera snapshots. System won't start until finished."
msgstr "正在拍攝攝影機快照。完成前系統將不會啟動。"

msgid "Tap a cell to cycle actions, then Save."
msgstr "點按儲存格循環切換動作，然後儲存。"

msgid "Target Branch"
msgstr "目標分支"

msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "溫度"

msgid "Test / Learn"
msgstr "鍵位學習 / 試驗"

msgid "Testing..."
msgstr "測試中…"

msgid "Tethering Password"
msgstr "網路共享密碼"

msgid "The amount added to the speed limit. Negative values go below it."
msgstr "在限速上增加的數值。負值會低於限速。"

msgid "The big model"
msgstr "大模型"

msgid ""
"The driver monitoring system can be toggled on/off, but long-term activation "
"is recommended"
msgstr "駕駛員監測系統可開關，建議保持長期開啟。"

msgid ""
"The driving model often cruises below your set speed and follows farther "
"back.\n"
"This drives toward them whenever the model holds back.\n"
"The model still makes every slowdown.\n"
"Long press home or hold the distance button to switch it."
msgstr ""
"駕駛模型常低於設定車速巡航且跟車更遠。\n"
"只要模型有所保留，就朝設定車速和跟車距離行駛。\n"
"模型仍會執行每一次減速。\n"
"長按主屏鍵或按住車距鍵切換。"

msgid ""
"The older way to drive the gas and brakes: hold your set speed and follow "
"the car ahead. It won't stop for red lights or stop signs.<br><br>Off, the "
"default, lets the driving model drive the gas and brakes as it thinks a "
"human would, including stopping for red lights and stop signs. The set speed "
"is then a maximum."
msgstr ""
"傳統的油門剎車控制方式：保持設定車速並跟隨前車。它不會在紅燈或停車標誌前停"
"車。<br><br>關閉（預設）時，由駕駛模型自主控制油門和剎車，包括在紅燈和停車標"
"誌前停車，設定車速此時為上限。"

msgid "The path will change colors to communicate acceleration intent."
msgstr "路徑會透過顏色變化傳達加速意圖。"

msgid "The reset cannot be undone. You have been warned."
msgstr "重置無法撤銷。你已被警告過。"

msgid "The set speed will only act as an upper bound."
msgstr "設定速度僅作為上限。"

msgid "The steering tune used while a big model drives."
msgstr "大模型駕駛時使用的轉向調校。"

msgid "The steering tune used while a small model drives."
msgstr "小模型駕駛時使用的轉向調校。"

msgid ""
"The wheel's TJA button becomes the only steering switch.\n"
"The MRCC button then only controls cruise.\n"
"Turn on only if your car has the button."
msgstr ""
"方向盤 TJA 按鍵成為唯一的轉向開關。\n"
"MRCC 按鍵只控制巡航。\n"
"僅當你的車有該按鍵時才開啟。"

msgid ""
"The wheel's TJA button becomes the only steering switch. The MRCC button "
"then only controls cruise. Turn on only if your car has the button."
msgstr ""
"方向盤 TJA 按鍵成為唯一的轉向開關，MRCC 按鍵只控制巡航。僅當你的車有該按鍵時"
"才開啟。"

msgid "Then"
msgstr "然後"

msgid ""
"This AGNOS kernel does not expose /dev/ttyHS1. Reflash to a Bluetooth-"
"capable AGNOS build."
msgstr "此 AGNOS 核心未開放 /dev/ttyHS1。請刷入支援藍牙的 AGNOS 版本。"

msgid "This alert will be cleared when new maps are downloaded."
msgstr "下載新地圖後此警報將清除。"

msgid "This allows the use of full MADS functionality when enabled."
msgstr "啟用後可使用完整的 MADS 功能。"

msgid "This car supports all When to Steer settings."
msgstr "此車型支援全部轉向時機設定。"

msgid "This car supports only some When to Steer settings."
msgstr "此車型僅支援部分轉向時機設定。"

msgid "This device or AGNOS build lacks /dev/btpower."
msgstr "此裝置或 AGNOS 版本缺少 /dev/btpower。"

msgid ""
"This device or AGNOS build lacks the required Bluetooth UART and power nodes."
