msgid ""
"Adds a small push on top of the planned acceleration, stronger in aggressive "
"and gentler in relaxed.\n"
"Eases off in curves and when slowing or stopping. Never goes past your set "
"speed."
msgstr ""
"在規劃加速度之上疊加小幅助推，激進個性下更強、放鬆個性下更柔和。\n"
"過彎以及減速、停車時會自動收力。永遠不會超過你的設定車速。"

msgid ""
"Adds an offset to the speed limit.\n"
"Fixed adds a set amount of speed. % adds a percentage of the limit.\n"
"Tiered adds a different offset for each speed limit range."
msgstr ""
"對限速增加一個偏移量。\n"
"固定：增加設定的速度值；%：按限速的百分比增加。\n"
"分段：為每個限速區間添加不同的偏移量。"

msgid "Allows the curve trigger while following a lead car."
msgstr "跟車時也允許彎道觸發。"

msgid ""
"Asks before taking a new speed limit. Adds to the low-speed confirmation, "
"never replaces it."
msgstr "採用新限速前先詢問確認。在低速確認的基礎上疊加，絕不會取代它。"

