msgid ""
"Choose what gets recorded on each route.\n"
"Full recording keeps logs plus all camera video. Logs only keeps the route "
"logs.\n"
"Disable all records nothing. A change applies to the next route after "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"選擇每段路程錄製的內容。\n"
"完整錄製保存日誌和所有攝影機視訊。僅日誌只保存路程日誌。\n"
"全部停用則不錄製任何內容。變更在重啟後對下一段路程生效。"

msgid ""
"Collects FLM lateral learning data while you drive and records verdicts as "
"telemetry.\n"
"It never changes steering."
msgstr ""
"行駛時收集 FLM 橫向學習數據，並將判定結果記錄到遙測。\n"
"絕不改變轉向。"

