msgstr "請連接可靠的 USB-C 轉接器和 Wi-Fi。"

msgid ""
"Controls the state of the device after boot or sleep.\n"
"Offroad keeps the device in always offroad mode after booting or waking up."
msgstr ""
"控制設備啟動或睡眠後的狀態。\n"
"離路：設備啟動或喚醒後將進入始終離路模式。"

