"Fixed steering ratio in 0.1 units (e.g. 130 = 13.0).\n"
"Overrides the live ratio when above 10. 0 uses the vehicle's ratio."
msgstr ""
"固定轉向比，0.1 單位（如 130 = 13.0）。\n"
"大於 10 時覆蓋即時轉向比。0 使用車輛即時值。"

msgid "For maximum effectiveness, bring your device inside weekly."
msgstr "為獲得最佳效果，請每週將設備帶到室內。"

msgid "Hides the firehose prompt on the home screen."
msgstr "隱藏首頁的 Firehose 提示。"

msgid ""
"How fast slow for curves takes turns.\n"
"Gentle slows more. Sporty slows less."
msgstr ""
"彎道減速的力度。\n"
"平緩減得更多，運動減得更少。"

