msgstr "更多數據意味著更大的模型，也就意味著更好的駕駛。"

msgid ""
"Mount the device within 4° left or right and 5° up or 9° down. openpilot "
"calibrates continuously; resetting is rarely needed. Resetting clears "
"learned calibration."
msgstr ""
"將設備安裝在左右偏差 4° 以內、上 5° 下 9° 以內的位置。openpilot 會持續校準，"
"很少需要重置。重置會清除已學習的校準。"

