"Replaces the driver monitoring camera thumbnail with animated pearl cartoon "
"eyes that mirror head pose and blinks."
msgstr "將駕駛員監控攝影機縮圖替換為會跟隨頭部姿態和眨眼的珍珠卡通動畫眼睛。"

