"Replaces the single following distance per personality with a speed-"
"dependent profile.\n"
"The follow time is interpolated over speed, so the gap can be shorter in "
"town and longer on the highway."
msgstr ""
"將每種駕駛個性的單一跟車距離替換為隨速度變化的跟車剖面。\n"
"跟車時間按速度插值，因此市區跟車距離可更短、高速可更長。"

