msgstr "將所有設定恢復為預設值，然後重啟設備。"

msgid ""
"Runs the traffic-light detector on the road camera and draws a box around "
"each\n"
"detected signal housing, with the observed signal written under the box.\n"
"Display only: it never feeds the planner. Check the light yourself."
msgstr ""
"在前視攝影機上執行紅綠燈偵測器，並在每個偵測到的號誌燈外畫框，\n"
"框下方顯示辨識到的號誌狀態。\n"
"僅用於顯示：絕不會輸入規劃器。請自行確認號誌。"

