#~ msgid ""
#~ "Macan Slope Comp Unlimited (sub-option): when Slope Compensation is ON, "
#~ "this removes the stock torque cap (option 2: min(max(stock_mom, 200))), "
#~ "giving small slopes room to act. When OFF, the stock cap applies (option "
#~ "1: min(stock_mom))."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Macan 坡度補償放開限制（子選項）：當坡度補償開啟時，本選項移除原廠力矩上限"
#~ "（選項2：min(max(stock_mom,200))），給小坡度留出作用空間。關閉時套用原廠上"
#~ "限（選項1：min(stock_mom)）。"

#~ msgid "Macan Slope Compensation"
#~ msgstr "Macan 坡度補償"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Macan Slope Compensation: when enabled, the IMU slope signal adds "
#~ "g*sin(slope) to the acceleration request - more torque uphill with a "
#~ "positive Verz request (declared acceleration, ~4.2*sin(slope)), a brief "
#~ "positive Verz ramp (+1.285 over 180ms) when overriding a deceleration "
#~ "with the gas pedal, and a brake tap downhill (prevents forward lurch). "
#~ "Default off = stock behavior. Onroad cycle restart is requested after "
#~ "toggling."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Macan 坡度補償：開啟後 IMU 坡度信號向加速度請求加入 g*sin(坡度)——上坡增加"
#~ "力矩並發出正向 Verz 請求（加速聲明，約 4.2×sin(坡度)）；減速中踩油門超馳時"
#~ "短暫發出正向 Verz 斜坡（+1.285/180ms，加速聲明儀式）；下坡輕點煞車（防止前"
#~ "衝）。預設關閉=原廠行為。切換後需重啟行程週期。"

#~ msgid "Macan Stop and Go"
#~ msgstr "Macan 跟停起步"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Macan Stop and Go: when enabled, the vision model decides when to start, "
#~ "and openpilot sends the RESUME signal to release the stock parking hold "
#~ "(with a chime). When disabled, gently press the gas or SET/RESUME to "
#~ "resume (stock behavior)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Macan 跟停起步：啟用後由視覺模型決定何時起步，openpilot 會傳送 RESUME 訊號"
#~ "解除原車駐車保持（並伴有提示音）。關閉時需輕踩油門或按 SET/RESUME 才起步"
#~ "（原廠行為）。"

#~ msgid "Macan Verz Bridge"
#~ msgstr "Macan 減速橋接"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Macan Verz Bridge: when ON, the bridge applies a percentage-based ramp to "
#~ "smooth the requested deceleration (step = 1.25% x |verz|) - softens "
#~ "abrupt OP-initiated braking and kills the breath/pulse. When OFF, the "
#~ "verz request passes through un-smoothed (one-frame, no ramp). Deep "
#~ "braking (<= -1.5) and OEM brake requests still pass through either way "
#~ "for safety."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Macan 減速橋接：啟用時，橋對減速請求施加基於百分比的緩升（步長 = 1.25% × |"
#~ "verz|），柔化 openpilot 自發的驟煞並消除喘氣感。關閉時減速請求不做平滑直接"
#~ "透傳。深煞（≤ -1.5）與原廠煞車請求無論開關均直通以保證安全。"

